52
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.500
Knowing your BATNA gives you massive
leverage in the room.

53
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Then, you're looking for the ZOPA, the
zone of possible agreement.

54
00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.500
Think of this as the sweet spot.

55
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:57.040
It's where your maximum budget and the
seller's absolute minimum price actually

56
00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:57.500
overlap.

57
00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:02.889
If they need a million bucks and you can
