59
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:07.500
If those numbers don't touch, well, a deal
just isn't going to happen.

60
00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.500
But look, ultimately, the goal within that
ZOPA is a true win-win scenario.

61
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.500
And a win-win isn't about aggressive
haggling or trying to crush the other guy.

62
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.707
It's heavily collaborative, it's about
problem solving, open communication, and

63
00:03:20.707 --> 00:03:25.021
building a trust-based relationship where
both sides walk away feeling good about

64
00:03:25.021 --> 00:03:25.500
the deal.

