68
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.343
When it's time to actually sign the
papers, you've got a few different ways to

69
00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:39.500
structure the relationship.

70
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.670
You could just do a single contract with
